Revision history for Data-Shared

0.02  2026-11-17
    - A backend older than its required version is reported like a missing one, naming the version to install; tests skip it instead of failing.

0.01  2026-10-29
    - Initial release: Linux shared-memory facade over 39 optional backends.
    - String, array and compiled paths with an XS fast path, composite structures and node cursors.
    - Persistent roots, retained storage, read-only opens and freeze/ship support.
